    "ans": [
      "Citizens from their (congressional) district"
    ],
    "why": "Voters in your district — and only your district — choose your representative.",
    "fun": "John Quincy Adams remains the only President elected to the U.S. House of Representatives after his service as commander in chief",
    "src": "house.gov",
    "terms": [],
