    "why": "Millions of people were taken from Africa and forced into slavery in the Americas. In the United States, slavery lasted from 1619 until 1865 — over 240 years. American freedom and prosperity were built, in part, on the unfree labor of enslaved people. Facing this honestly is part of being an American.",
