    "fun": "Thomas Jefferson designed his own gravestone and listed exactly 3 things he wanted to be remembered for: writer of the Declaration of Independence, writer of the Virginia Statute on Religious Freedom, and founder of the University of Virginia. He said 'not a word more.' He didn't even mention being President.",
